1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,120
Dexter: Hey, remember when we played Cattin with Bobby last Friday?

2
00:00:03,470 --> 00:00:08,630
Milo: Yeah. He built the longest road and then wouldn't trade me a single sheep. Total tyrant.

3
00:00:08,980 --> 00:00:11,040
Dexter: Don't you get a feeling... when you watch him play like that?

4
00:00:11,540 --> 00:00:14,660
Milo: Wha... what? What do you mean, a feeling? Like, indigestion?

5
00:00:15,010 --> 00:00:20,880
Dexter: The way he moves the pieces... the way he builds. That long... long road of his. And the way he whispers, ore for wheat.

6
00:00:21,280 --> 00:00:23,840
Milo: I... guess? He does have really good settlement placement?

7
00:00:24,190 --> 00:00:27,200
Dexter: And when he rolled a seven and moved the robber? I had to leave the room.

8
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:29,090
Milo: Dude. We were playing at your house.

9
00:00:29,450 --> 00:00:32,060
Dexter: So... you also find him sexy when he plays Cattin?
